How's it going? I was just wondering if I could ask for you and mom's help on 
a few things before the end of the summer. First, I want to start advertising 
my Jeep for sale, so I was hoping you might spruce it up a bit for me. It 
just needs a good cleaning inside and out (i.e. Lazerwash) before getting its 
picture taken for the ads. Also, the sticker on the rear window should be 
removed and it probably wouldn't hurt to have it Mr. Lubed one more time.

