Kathy,

The port_calc  version you have now when run from the port_calc screen in the 
egsstage environment doesn't include the changes for the "Implicit reports" 
related functionalities. This is because the current setup is for a testing 
version which is being used by the Houston currently.

To solve this problem, we have just put a run script : 
/home/kreeve/port_calc/run_implcit in your directory: /home/kreeve/port_cal.

For the testing, cd to /home/kreeve/port_cal,  then run the script:  
run_implcit  postid (you need to set up a postid for the test run).

To get the reports, you can still use the port_calc screen brought up in the 
egsstage environment (you can bring it up by typing: runmt on the command 
line)

postid 747584 is still available in the production environment, to run the 
test version of port_calc in egsstage, you need to have a data set in the 
egsstage database.


