off of it. 

Check out enron stock (ENE). We announced an alliance with Sun Microsystems 
to build a bandwidth network and the stock has doubled in a month. Not bad 
for a small Texas pipeline company. You would need a sand blaster to get the 
smile off of Lavorato's face. However I don't think I'm going to retire on my 
Enron options any time soon.

Gotta hop!

Dorland

