.  If ERCOT's position is that within the text of the Protocols, OOMC means=
 "running", then unacceptable risks are presented to our Customer and to EP=
MI as their QSE.  If such is ERCOT's position, then they should cite us cha=
pter and verse for that position within the Protocols, offsetting the clear=
