they carry Magis furniture and the time for ordering would be approximately
3 months.  No big deal, however, when I asked about price, they would not
answer that over the phone.  They wanted me to come into the store so that
they could consult me.  I don't think I need to be consulted on design.  I
know what I want and all I was using them for was to order.  They said it
was store policy not to quote prices over the phone because of competition.
