 Kehl (E-mail)"	 <philip.kehl@msdw.com>, "Randall & Dewey, Inc." <library@randew.com>, "Randy Hale (E-mail)" <cinasset@ix.netcom.com>, "Raymond Kennedy (E-mail)" <kennedy@pimco.com>, "Raymond M. Bowen Jr. (E-mail)" <raymond.bowen@enron.com>, "Rebecca Prothro (E-mail)" <spnx@spinexp.com>, "Revell Horsey (E-mail)"	 <rhorsey@bofasecurities.com>, "Richard B. Buy (E-mail)"	 <rick.buy@enron.com>, "Richard D. Griffis (E-mail)"	 <rgriffis@ogclearinghouse.com>, "Richard Kauffman (E-mail)"	 <richard.kauffman@msdw.com>, "Richard Lewis (E-mail)" <rnl@capgroup.com>, "Rinaldo Zangirolami (E-mail)" <rzangirolam@schahin.com.br>, "Robert A. Odd (E-mail)" <robert.odd@bmo.com>, "ROBERT J. CUNNINGHAM (E-mail)" <robert.j.cunningham@marshmc.com>, "Robert Morris (E-mail)" <robert.s.morris@ssmb.com>, Robin Starrett - Bridge <RStarrett@bridge.com>, "Rodney D. Kubicek (E-mail)" <rodney.kubicek@abnamro.com>, "Ron Ormand (E-mail)" <ron.ormand@us.cibc.com>, "Ronald L. Dierker (E-mail)" <ronald_dierker@em.fcnbd.com>, "Rosie Castillo (E-mail)" <rosie.castillo@enron.com>, "Ross Payne (E-mail)" <mike.layden@capmark.funb.com>, "Sean Mitchell (E-mail)" <mitchell@scotiacapital.com>, "Shannon L. Nome (E-mail)" <snome@bofasecurities.com>, soh@sunamerica.com, "Stephen Kuntz (E-mail)" <skuntz@fulbright.com>, "Steve Croxson (E-mail)"	 <croxson@idt.net>, "STEVE HORN (E-mail)" <roninhorn@aol.com>, "Steve Shapiro (E-mail)" <shapiro@offitbank.com>, "Steven M. Trauber (E-mail)" <stephen.trauber@msdw.com>, "Steven Schweitzer (E-mail)" <sns@scm-highyield.com>, "Steven Tholen (E-mail)" <stholen@pennvirginia.com>, "T. Frank Murphy (E-mail)" <murphyTF@agedwards.com>, "Talbot Theiss (E-mail)" <talbot.theiss@synertechllc.com>, "Thomas E. Hassen (E-mail)" <thomas.hassen@csfb.com>, "Thomas W. Regan (E-mail)" <regant@tdusa.com>, "Tim Hutfilz (E-mail)"	 <tim.hutfilz@gs.com>, "Tim Proffitt (E-mail)" <tim.proffitt@enron.com>, "Tom Hughes (E-mail)" <tom_hughes@prnewswire.com>, "Tom Petrie (E-mail)"	 <tomp@ppcdenver.com>, "To